+Translations:\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb3 (1)\'a0 You are in danger.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb3 (2)\'a0 They\'92re coming.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb3 (3)\'a0 They will come from below. Pies will not help.\
