+
+[^2]: [Recommendation of the Council on Artificial Intelligence OECD/LEGAL/0449, Organization for Economic and Co-operation Development (OECD), 2024](https://legalinstruments.oecd.org/en/instruments/OECD-LEGAL-0449)
+
+[^3]: [Explanatory memorandum on the updated OECD definition of an AI system, OECD Artificial Intelligence Papers, No. 8, OECD Publishing, Paris](https://doi.org/10.1787/623da898-en)
